              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In this reaction, Ag"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is reduced to Ag and Fe is oxidized to Fe"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". Balancing and adding the half-reactions gives the overall reaction and standard cell potential: "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3493034899",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "lo7elm6ld3h0aji",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2422909862",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{reduction}:\\;\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Ag}^+(aq)\\;+\\;2\\;\\mathrm e^-\\;\\rightarrow\\; 2\\;\\mathrm{Ag}(s)\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\mathrm E^\\circ\\; =\\;+0.80\\;\\mathrm V\\\\\\underline{\\mathrm{oxidation}:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm{Fe}(s)\\;\\rightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Fe}^{2+}(aq)\\;+\\;2\\mathrm e^-\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm E^\\circ\\;=\\;+0.45\\;\\mathrm V}\\\\\\mathrm{overall}:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Ag}^+(\\mathrm{aq})\\; +\\;\\mathrm{Fe}(s)\\;\\rightarrow\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Ag}(\\mathrm s)\\;+\\;\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}(aq\\mathit)\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm E^\\circ\\;=\\;+1.25\\;\\mathrm V\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The same result is obtained using "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "2767032077",
                    "src": "{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{cell}}\\;=\\;{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{cathode}}\\; -\\;{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{anode}}",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
